# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# The site is the Next.js app in web/, which has its own .gitignore covering
# node_modules, .next, env files, tsbuildinfo and its dev/server logs. Those
# rules are NOT duplicated here — one owner per concern. This file covers only
# what sits at the repository root or in the sibling folders.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Large local media -----------------------------------------------------
# ~290 MB of source footage. Kept on disk, never committed.
# mudra.mp4 (2.9 MB) is already tracked from earlier work and stays tracked.
/Hastas.mp4

# --- Vite prototype in globefolio-3d-image-animation/ ----------------------
/globefolio-3d-image-animation/node_modules/
/globefolio-3d-image-animation/dist/
/globefolio-3d-image-animation/.env
/globefolio-3d-image-animation/.env.local

# --- Python tooling in _research/ and _build/ ------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Browser automation scratch --------------------------------------------
# NOTE: .playwright-mcp/ is already TRACKED, so this rule does not remove the
# existing files from the index — it only stops new ones being added. To drop
# the history too, run: git rm -r --cached .playwright-mcp
/.playwright-mcp/

# --- Vendored skills -------------------------------------------------------
# .kiro/skills/ IS committed (~6 MB). It is the project's design toolchain, all
# three upstreams are permissively licensed, and the skills cannot function
# without their bundled data — ui-ux-pro-max is a searchable database, not prose.
# See .kiro/skills/NOTICES.md for attribution.
#
# Only runtime scratch is excluded. impeccable's launcher caches its engine
# binary outside the repo, so nothing is needed for that.
/.kiro/skills/**/__pycache__/
/.kiro/skills/**/*.pyc
/.kiro/skills/impeccable/scripts/bin/

# --- Editor and OS noise ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
*.bak

# --- Agent tooling scratch -------------------------------------------------
# Session-continuation state written by a local agent runner. Machine-specific
# and meaningless to anyone else.
/.omo/
